<title>HUNGARY: Konzum group reports '96 ias pre-tax loss.</title>
<headline>Konzum group reports '96 ias pre-tax loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Dec 1996    Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating result	  73.0 loss vs    33.4 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	   163.9 loss vs    81.9 profit</p>
<p>    Group net sales		1,302.0	vs 2,582.2</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	     20.8	vs    81.2</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	  459.9     vs    549.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	 311.3     vs    399.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation			59.2     vs     66.6</p>
<p>    Other costs			119.1     vs    136.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		54.5     vs    133.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    62.2 loss vs    16.6 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	     78.0     vs    128.7</p>
<p>	Financial expend.	    140.2     vs    145.2</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	28.6 loss vs   131.9 profit</p>
<p>	Extraord. revenue		0.8     vs    150.4</p>
<p>	Extraord. expend.	     29.4     vs     18.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Konzum is a trading company. The figures are consolidated, they were prepared in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
